ia-label=\"Close\"`. Override it via `ariaLabels={{ close: '...' }}` to provide more specific context for screen readers (e.g. `\"Dismiss payment warning\"`). This is especially useful when multiple alerts are visible at the same time."},"49":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-25","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"Write alert content from the user's perspective: describe what happened and what they can do next, not the underlying technical error."},"50":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-26","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"Use `critical` only when the user truly cannot continue without resolving the issue. Overusing it reduces its impact."},"51":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-27","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"Always provide a `title` when the alert includes a dismiss button — it improves the reading experience for screen reader users."},"52":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-28","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"When using `actions`, prefer `secondary` or `tertiary` Button variants. Avoid placing a primary action inside an alert."},"53":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-29","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"Do not stack multiple alerts of the same emphasis; consolidate the message into a single alert."},"54":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","type":"page","content":"Avatar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/avatar"},"55":{"id":"/docs/components/avatar-0","page_id":"/docs/components/avatar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/avatar","content":"A visual representation of a user or entity, shown as