ually exclusive options (use `Radio` or `SegmentedController` instead)"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-73","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"Prefer a visible label that names the setting being toggled (e.g. \"Wi-Fi\", not \"On/Off\")"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-74","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"If the label is omitted, always provide `aria-label`"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-75","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"Keep labels short and describe the setting, not its current state"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-76","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#props","content":"The `Switch` component has the following props:"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","type":"page","content":"Tabs","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tabs"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs-0","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tabs","content":"Tabs organize peer sections of content and let users switch between them without leaving the page."},"1295":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs-1","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tabs#features","content":"Features"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs-2","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tabs#installation","content":"Installation"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs-3","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tabs#examples","content":"Examples"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/components/tabs-4","page_id":"/docs/components/tabs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tabs#default"