ple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[833,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1179,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1421,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[831,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1644,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1586,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1620,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1595,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[593,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1267,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1264,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1273,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1274,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1262,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1268,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1271,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1265,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1277,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[150,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[1826,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1828,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[1822,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[1824,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[1829,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[1825,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1823,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1827,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1779,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[447,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1028,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1152,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[348,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[220,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1029,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1153,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[222,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1031,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1490,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1154,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[347,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[979,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[221,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1030,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[345,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[977,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[976,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value"],[344,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[978,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[346,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1771,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[149,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[206,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[300,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[318,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[296,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[311,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1530,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[1740,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1214,"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."],[945,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[568,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[571,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[567,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[569,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[570,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[572,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1255,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[368,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[401,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[877,"`Enter/Space`"],[473,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[659,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[410,"`Escape`"],[805,"`Escape`"],[879,"`Escape`"],[1535,"`Escape`"],[446,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[1808,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[576,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[1846,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[492,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[647,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[676,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[1723,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[1777,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[749,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label